{"4584170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "On The Ramp", "steam_appid": 4584170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rival is right there – you're racing side-by-side, fighting for the next jump, the next corner. You've barely regained control after a landing, and you're neck-and-neck again. A ramp. A flight spanning dozens of meters. Suspension pushed to its absolute limit. Touching down at 140 km/h. Another corner. Another jump. And the speed just keeps climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a cheap frame and a modest 120 horses. It's a fight for survival. You build your reputation race by race, and as your name grows, so does your workshop. Customers' money goes straight back into your machine: a V8 engine, forced induction, 600 horsepower. Lighter wheels. Long-travel suspension. Aerodynamics – but which ones? Cheap and heavy, or bare pipes to save weight? Or perhaps carbon fiber, costing every cent of your savings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by Stunt Car Racer — back when suspension was something you could see.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rival is right there – you're racing side-by-side, fighting for the next jump, the next corner. You've barely regained control after a landing, and you're neck-and-neck again. A ramp. A flight spanning dozens of meters. Suspension pushed to its absolute limit. Touching down at 140 km/h. Another corner. Another jump. And the speed just keeps climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a cheap frame and a modest 120 horses. It's a fight for survival. You build your reputation race by race, and as your name grows, so does your workshop. Customers' money goes straight back into your machine: a V8 engine, forced induction, 600 horsepower. Lighter wheels. Long-travel suspension. Aerodynamics – but which ones? Cheap and heavy, or bare pipes to save weight? Or perhaps carbon fiber, costing every cent of your savings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by Stunt Car Racer — back when suspension was something you could see.</i></p>", "short_description": "Your rival is right there. A ramp. Dozens of meters of air. Suspension at its limit. Touching down at 140. You started with 120 horses and a cheap frame. Race to get noticed. Build the rest.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584170/f650cff32de917c407e1ad474cca2e17d8b1f321/header.jpg?t=1788348113", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584170/dae596195ce95c8f84aabc00ed830d4267c2ec0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788348113", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584170/dae596195ce95c8f84aabc00ed830d4267c2ec0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788348113", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-12400 or Ryzen 5 550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> HDA</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["FromGamers4Gamers"], "publishers": ["FromGamers4Gamers"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "9", "description": "Racing"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584170/88c2de9600240d4d51ad3795709ad